id_count_new.txt  	 --------> GeneID of SEG that are present in all pipelines with number of pipelines in which they are found 
lda/			 --------> LDA plot of 16 pipelines  
seg_12_pipelines.xlsx    --------> SEG that are present in 12 pipelines 
16_pipelenes_genes.txt   --------> Genes present in all 16 pipelines which shows distitinct classes in LDA
auc/         		 --------> AUC ROC curve plot for 16 pipelines
genes_all_pipeline_name.xlsx ----> Genes that are present in all pipelines with name of pipelines in which they are found
